				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740101901,
					"content": "聞著須彌薔薇的香氣，總會忍不住想起用它做的美味料理呢！薔薇奶糊啦、棗椰蜜糖啦、還有蘭巴德魚卷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740101902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740101902,
					"content": "這就是派蒙愛吃的須彌薔薇…嗯，有許多的花瓣，也有許多種顏色呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740101903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 740101903,
					"content": "欸，須彌薔薇…有許多種顏色？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740101904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740101904,
					"content": "對呀，各色的花瓣湊成了花朵，晃動起來還會變色…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740101905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 740101905,
					"content": "還…還會變色？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740101906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740101906,
					"content": "原來是這樣，放入須彌薔薇，料理也會變得五彩繽紛，也會變色了！樣子這麼美麗，難怪派蒙會喜歡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740101907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 740101907,
					"content": "料理看起來五彩繽紛會變色…這應該是吃了毒蘑菇才會出現的症狀吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7401020,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7401003
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"柯莎"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740102001,
					"content": "沒想到，柯莎對花朵的印象會和我們差別這麼大…解釋起來又那麼困難…有點傷腦筋。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740102002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740102002,
					"content": "為什麼要傷腦筋呢？派蒙認為很美麗的花朵，在柯莎眼中也是一樣的美麗呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740102003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 740102003,
					"content": "美麗是美麗，但並不「一樣」啦…不過喜愛花朵的心情確實是共通的。那就先不糾結這些，好好地照料花朵吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740102004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740102004,
					"content": "嗯！接下來柯莎要去裝一些<color=#00E1FFFF>水</color>來，澆灌珍貴的花朵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740102005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 740102005,
					"content": "沒必要跑一趟，讓我來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740102006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740102006,
					"content": "#對呀，放心交給{NICKNAME}吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
